  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among beast kings ranked by group size, hundred beast king sits lowest, below Thousand Beast King and Myriad Beast King. The jade eye stone monkey king before Fang Yuan is a hundred beast king with only several hundred stone monkeys under its rule. A regular five man group can handle a king of this tier.",
      "chapters": [
        114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_thousand_beast_king",
        "sys_myriad_beast_king",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That stone monkey king lacks the reach to control every monkey group in its stone forest. In ten or more years it might advance to thousand beast king and unify the forest; as a hundred beast king it cannot yet.",
      "chapters": [
        115
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a full lightning wolf nest, bold lightning wolves stand at hundred beast king level beside thousand beast king frenzy lightning wolves and myriad beast king thunder crown wolves.",
      "chapters": [
        130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wolf-tide-examples",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reports of a hundred beast king bold lightning wolf frighten rank two Gu Masters in the field; the danger of any beast king class lightning wolf still turns on the Gu on its body.",
      "chapters": [
        131
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
